2026-05-10 11:46:10,687 - INFO - - **Other factors influence outcomes**: Cost isn't the only metric; quality, access, and equity play huge roles. Government systems generally provide better universal coverage, reducing inequalities, but they can face issues like long wait times. Private systems might innovate more but often leave vulnerable populations behind.
